        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\n@startuml\ntitle UC6 - TRA CUU HO SO BENH AN\n\nleft to right direction\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\n\nactor \&quot;Bac si\&quot; as BS\nactor \&quot;Nhan vien\&quot; as NV\n\nrectangle \&quot;HE THONG QUAN LY HO SO BENH AN\&quot; {\n\n  usecase \&quot;Tra cuu ho so benh an\&quot; as UC6\n  usecase \&quot;Nhap thong tin tim kiem\&quot; as UC61\n  usecase \&quot;Tim kiem ho so benh an\&quot; as UC62\n  usecase \&quot;Kiem tra ho so ton tai\&quot; as UC63\n  usecase \&quot;Hien thi thong tin benh nhan\&quot; as UC64\n  usecase \&quot;Xem lich su kham benh\&quot; as UC65\n  usecase \&quot;Xem ket qua xet nghiem\&quot; as UC66\n  usecase \&quot;Xem lich su toa thuoc\&quot; as UC67\n  usecase \&quot;Thong bao khong tim thay\&quot; as UC68\n\n}\n\nBS -- UC6\nNV -- UC6\n\nBS -- UC65\nBS -- UC66\nBS -- UC67\n\nUC6 ..&gt; UC61 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC6 ..&gt; UC62 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC6 ..&gt; UC63 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\nUC64 ..&gt; UC6 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\nUC65 ..&gt; UC6 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\nUC66 ..&gt; UC6 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\nUC67 ..&gt; UC6 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\nUC68 ..&gt; UC6 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\nnote right of UC68\n  Thuc hien khi\n  khong tim thay ho so\nend note\n\nnote right of UC65\n  Thuc hien khi ho so\n  ton tai va bac si\n  can xem lich su kham\nend note\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="KhnMYgAfbm0gDm6oT-Hf-102">
