        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\n@startuml\ntitle ACTIVITY DIAGRAM - KIEM TRA THONG TIN BENH NHAN\n\n|Nhan vien|\nstart\n:Tiep nhan thong tin benh nhan;\n:Nhap ma ho so hoac thong tin tim kiem;\n\n|He thong|\n:Tim kiem thong tin benh nhan;\n\nif (Tim thay benh nhan?) then (Co)\n  :Hien thi thong tin benh nhan;\n  :Hien thi ho so benh an;\n\n  |Nhan vien|\n  :Kiem tra va xac minh thong tin;\n\n  if (Thong tin chinh xac?) then (Co)\n    |He thong|\n    :Xac nhan thong tin hop le;\n  else (Khong)\n    |Nhan vien|\n    :Yeu cau bo sung thong tin;\n    :Cap nhat thong tin benh nhan;\n\n    |He thong|\n    :Kiem tra thong tin cap nhat;\n    :Luu thong tin moi;\n    :Xac nhan thong tin hop le;\n  endif\n\nelse (Khong)\n  :Thong bao khong tim thay benh nhan;\nendif\n\n|He thong|\n:Thong bao ket qua kiem tra;\n\nstop\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="o8spvxiHmKO46t7eJB9i-77">
